:: Prologue_WakeUp {"position":"500,0","size":"100,100"}
<<set $inventory to []>>
    <<set $gameClockActive to false>> /* Time is frozen during intro */
    
<<script>>
    /* STATIC STARTS (ID: static) */
    setup.sound.play("static", "audio/sfx/static.mp3", true, 0.4);
<</script>>

<center>
<div class="tv-container">
    <img src="image/static.gif">
</div>
<br>
<div class="glitch" style="font-size: 2.5em;">SSSHHHHHKKKKK...</div>
</center>
<br><br>

<<timed 1s>>
The sound cuts through your dreams like a saw blade. White noise.
<</timed>>

<<timed 3s>>
You jolt awake. The living room is bathed in the cold, flickering glow of the television.
<</timed>>

<<timed 6s>>
But the power is on. The lights on the modem are blinking frantically. 
<</timed>>

<<timed 10s>>
<<script>>
    /* SIRENS FADE IN (ID: siren) */
    setup.sound.play("siren", "audio/sfx/sirens.mp3", true, 0.3);
<</script>>

Outside the window, beyond the thin glass, you hear it. A distant, rising chorus of sirens. 
<</timed>>

<<timed 14s>>
<<script>>
    /* SHORT SCREAM (ID: scream) - Loop is FALSE */
    setup.sound.play("scream", "audio/sfx/scream.mp3", false, 0.9);
<</script>>

And underneath that... <span style="color:red">screaming.</span>
<</timed>>

<<timed 18s>>
You stumble to the balcony door. You catch your reflection in the darkened glass.
<br><br>

<div style="text-align:center;">
    <<button "Focus on your reflection...">>
        <<script>>
            /* Fade out atmosphere over 2 seconds */
            setup.sound.fade("static", 2000);
            setup.sound.fade("siren", 2000);
            
            setTimeout(function() {
                Engine.play("Create_Gender");
            }, 2000);
        <</script>>
    <</button>>
</div>
<</timed>>